    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L856-949) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 4-species wavelength Pearson r = 0.9999 (p = 3.5e-24, RMSE = 0.025 mm), 4-species radius Pearson r = 0.9999 (p = 1.9e-23, RMSE = 0.010 mm), log-log scaling exponent alpha = 0.9963 ± 0.0044 (ref 1.0), Chick E12 relaxed 3D rod wavelength 3.1132 mm (ref 3.12 mm) and radius 1.1499 mm (ref 1.15 mm), surgical ablation tortuosity 1.0000 (ref 1.0), BMP2/Noggin loop-count ratio 1.8581 (ref 2.0909), specimen inter-loop spacing CV = 0.2319, and cross-species lambda/R = 2.7126 (ref 2.7083)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
